WEBVTT

00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:09.940
Is this the post-meal...

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:11.460
water?

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:13.820
What are you saying?

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:15.240
It's mate.

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:21.000
What a difference.

00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:36.250
You see...

00:00:42.130 --> 00:00:45.270
I want to pass my magic on to you.

00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:46.370
What?

00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:49.230
You'll teach me magic?

00:00:49.590 --> 00:00:50.310
Yes.

00:00:55.030 --> 00:00:56.810
But why?

00:00:57.660 --> 00:01:00.620
I don't have any money, you know?

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:04.990
I don't want money.

00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:10.740
I just...

00:01:28.310 --> 00:01:30.010
I just want a disciple.

00:01:33.550 --> 00:01:36.670
Anyway, I'll do anything if I can learn magic!

00:01:36.670 --> 00:01:38.980
Please teach me, master!

00:01:42.250 --> 00:01:45.010
Then we begin training tomorrow.

00:01:45.870 --> 00:01:46.870
Oh, right.

00:01:46.870 --> 00:01:49.580
Keep the magic thing between us.

00:01:50.900 --> 00:01:53.050
I have to keep it secret?

00:01:53.610 --> 00:01:55.800
If people find out you can use magic,

00:01:55.800 --> 00:02:00.850
some retainers or subjects might say 
you should be the next lord instead,

00:02:00.850 --> 00:02:03.060
leading to a succession dispute.

00:02:03.510 --> 00:02:05.260
Me? The next lord?

00:02:05.260 --> 00:02:07.230
But I'm the eighth son.

00:02:13.290 --> 00:02:14.130
Well...

00:02:16.230 --> 00:02:21.000
Magicians hold more power than you think.

00:02:21.710 --> 00:02:26.550
You could become the rightful successor 
and next lord in a heartbeat.

00:02:30.360 --> 00:02:32.850
Me? Really?

00:02:33.530 --> 00:02:37.510
<i>That said, a succession dispute is 
too dangerous for a child like you.</i>

00:02:38.600 --> 00:02:42.500
<i>For now, I think it'll be better 
if nobody finds out.</i>

00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:46.510
What? You can't have any more bread, okay?

00:02:48.700 --> 00:02:50.300
<i>I see.</i>

00:02:50.300 --> 00:02:52.500
<i>I can become the lord, huh?</i>

00:02:53.730 --> 00:02:54.510
<i>So bland!</i>

00:03:15.020 --> 00:03:24.170
The 8th Son?
 Are You Kidding Me?

00:03:15.020 --> 00:03:24.170
The 8th Son?
 Are You Kidding Me?

00:03:15.020 --> 00:03:24.170
The 8th Son?
 Are You Kidding Me?

00:03:15.020 --> 00:03:24.170
The 8th Son?
 Are You Kidding Me?

00:03:15.020 --> 00:03:24.170
The 8th Son?
 Are You Kidding Me?

00:03:15.020 --> 00:03:24.170
The 8th Son?
 Are You Kidding Me?

00:03:15.020 --> 00:03:24.170
The 8th Son?
 Are You Kidding Me?

00:03:15.020 --> 00:03:24.170
The 8th Son?
 Are You Kidding Me?

00:04:27.020 --> 00:04:30.140
Let's start with matching capacities.

00:04:27.720 --> 00:04:32.690
\hEpisode 2
"A Succession Dispute? Are You Kidding Me?"

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:31.980
Matching what?

00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:35.070
A training method where one can match their

00:04:35.070 --> 00:04:37.920
mana capacity to someone who has more.

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:41.380
You mean my capacity will 
become the same as yours?

00:04:41.730 --> 00:04:42.460
Yes.

00:04:42.870 --> 00:04:44.340
Hold out your hands.

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:49.890
You have cold hands.

00:04:52.650 --> 00:04:53.890
Listen, Well.

00:04:53.890 --> 00:04:59.150
Picture mana circulating through both our 
bodies over this circuit we've formed.

00:05:00.430 --> 00:05:03.110
Circulate mana...

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:05.630
Circulate mana...

00:05:05.630 --> 00:05:08.010
Circulate mana...

00:05:16.370 --> 00:05:17.640
This is...

00:05:18.480 --> 00:05:20.000
your mana?

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:25.920
I was right about you.

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:31.320
A person's maximum mana capacity 
is determined at birth.

00:05:31.320 --> 00:05:33.480
It doesn't increase any further.

00:05:34.630 --> 00:05:40.310
So I was thinking that maybe you 
wouldn't be able to reach my capacity,

00:05:40.310 --> 00:05:43.630
but you matched... and even surpassed it.

00:05:43.630 --> 00:05:47.990
We didn't even hit your maximum mana capacity.

00:05:54.230 --> 00:05:56.710
What's the matter, Father?

00:05:57.240 --> 00:05:59.820
You see, the crystal ball

00:05:59.820 --> 00:06:02.250
was up here before, I'm sure.

00:06:03.290 --> 00:06:04.520
Who moved it?

00:06:08.340 --> 00:06:09.560
Was it Wendelin?

00:06:10.220 --> 00:06:14.570
Was he hoping that he had 
an aptitude for magic?

00:06:16.900 --> 00:06:19.470
He probably despaired at his mediocre self

00:06:19.470 --> 00:06:21.270
and cried his heart out.

00:06:31.520 --> 00:06:33.010
That's a nice magic spell.

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:37.580
I can't believe you learned 
advanced magic in just a few days.

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:39.110
It's all thanks to you.

00:06:39.110 --> 00:06:41.030
If I were training alone,

00:06:41.030 --> 00:06:43.480
I don't know if I'd have even learned 
how to use basic magic yet.

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:44.550
Uh...

00:06:44.910 --> 00:06:46.070
What's with the basket?

00:06:46.070 --> 00:06:47.950
Oh, it's mountain vegetables.

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:53.470
You told your family you were 
going out to find food, right?

00:06:54.100 --> 00:06:56.200
This will help you avoid any suspicion.

00:06:58.490 --> 00:07:00.390
Look, Amalie!

00:07:00.390 --> 00:07:02.350
We have so many ingredients 
for our soup tonight.

00:07:02.890 --> 00:07:06.110
It seems Well may have a knack 
for foraging mountain vegetables!

00:07:10.890 --> 00:07:11.630
Hey...

00:07:12.210 --> 00:07:14.200
How did you get this?

00:07:14.530 --> 00:07:19.330
I know it only grows on the other side 
of the river, and there's no bridge across.

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:21.750
You're only five. How did you get across?

00:07:22.800 --> 00:07:24.390
Did you use magic to fly?

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:28.810
Of course not!

00:07:30.210 --> 00:07:31.590
If only...

00:07:34.500 --> 00:07:37.640
<i>Magic... Surely he couldn't...</i>

00:07:42.450 --> 00:07:43.520
Listen.

00:07:43.520 --> 00:07:46.730
Tracking magic is an application 
of advanced wind magic.

00:07:47.160 --> 00:07:51.010
Sense the vibrations in the 
web of air all around you.

00:07:57.740 --> 00:07:59.120
Found one!

00:08:11.520 --> 00:08:13.440
Go!

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:17.100
I got it!

00:08:17.840 --> 00:08:19.060
Got what?!

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:25.980
Grilled bird is so yummy!

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:27.300
The horohoro bird, huh?

00:08:27.850 --> 00:08:28.940
What's that?

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:32.690
Oh, it's wasabi I found deep 
in the woods the other day.

00:08:32.690 --> 00:08:34.340
Would you like to try some, Master?

00:08:34.340 --> 00:08:35.500
It's good.

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:39.710
I'm sure it is, if you're recommending it.

00:08:40.360 --> 00:08:41.160
Do I use it like this?

00:08:46.660 --> 00:08:48.680
Yes, this is great!

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:55.370
Well, can I say something?

00:08:55.370 --> 00:08:56.800
G-Go ahead.

00:08:56.800 --> 00:08:59.000
Don't go too deep into the woods.

00:08:59.390 --> 00:09:00.360
Why?

00:09:00.680 --> 00:09:04.270
The Enchanted Forest there 
is home to lots of monsters.

00:09:04.270 --> 00:09:05.370
Monsters?!

00:09:05.840 --> 00:09:09.340
Savage beasts that ordinary 
humans are no match for.

00:09:10.650 --> 00:09:14.140
I nearly lost my life getting wasabi.

00:09:14.640 --> 00:09:15.740
May I have more?

00:09:18.150 --> 00:09:20.850
That said, an Enchanted Forest

00:09:20.850 --> 00:09:25.160
is also home to foodstuffs and 
herbs you won't find elsewhere.

00:09:25.770 --> 00:09:30.290
Many people still waltz into 
them looking to get rich quick.

00:09:30.650 --> 00:09:31.770
And?

00:09:34.360 --> 00:09:37.720
They never come back, of course.

00:09:42.030 --> 00:09:45.930
I feel like Brother Kurt's 
been watching me lately.

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:54.740
He may have realized that you have magic.

00:09:57.470 --> 00:10:00.410
He's afraid he'll lose his succession rights.

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:02.400
That again?

00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:05.370
I don't know what to think
about becoming a lord.

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:08.330
Don't you want to be the lord?

00:10:08.780 --> 00:10:11.220
I considered it,

00:10:11.220 --> 00:10:15.670
but it sounds like a pain in the butt, 
especially if it causes trouble with Brother Kurt.

00:10:21.830 --> 00:10:23.720
Being the lord sounds like
 a pain in the butt, huh?

00:10:25.670 --> 00:10:29.690
That said, it's not like I have 
anything else I want to do.

00:10:30.990 --> 00:10:33.160
Then how about adventuring?

00:10:35.810 --> 00:10:39.900
I think your adaptability makes you an 
ideal candidate to be an adventurer.

00:10:40.340 --> 00:10:43.840
And I used to be an adventurer, 
so you can believe me.

00:10:44.530 --> 00:10:45.720
You did?

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:49.110
You have what it takes to enjoy 
what the wide world has to offer.

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:51.410
An adventurer, huh?

00:11:02.820 --> 00:11:05.840
<i>Please, not yet... I need 
a little more time!</i>

00:11:09.570 --> 00:11:10.320
I see.

00:11:10.940 --> 00:11:13.410
So you want to be an adventurer, Wendelin.

00:11:13.880 --> 00:11:14.910
Oh?

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:18.360
So you wish to go to the Adventurers' Academy?

00:11:18.820 --> 00:11:22.320
Yes. I'm thinking of enrolling 
once I turn twelve.

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:25.280
But isn't that on the other 
side of the mountains?

00:11:25.280 --> 00:11:28.750
So you'll be leaving the Baumeister domain?

00:11:32.810 --> 00:11:36.170
But you see, there's one big problem with that.

00:11:36.650 --> 00:11:37.880
What is it?

00:11:37.880 --> 00:11:41.590
We don't have enough money to enroll 
you in the Adventurers' Academy.

00:11:46.510 --> 00:11:47.330
Listen up.

00:11:46.530 --> 00:11:47.310
Baumeister Knightdom

00:11:46.530 --> 00:11:50.550
Rigdie Mountain Range

00:11:46.530 --> 00:11:51.520
Undeveloped Land

00:11:47.770 --> 00:11:50.550
This is the Baumeister Knightdom.

00:11:50.550 --> 00:11:53.130
And to the north, past the mountains,

00:11:51.830 --> 00:11:53.400
Dukedom of
\h\h\h\h Bleichröder

00:11:51.830 --> 00:11:53.520
Breichburg

00:11:53.130 --> 00:11:57.480
is the Dukedom of Bleichröder 
and Breichburg.

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:57.470
Dukedom of
\h\h\h\h Bleichröder

00:11:53.940 --> 00:11:57.470
Breichburg

00:11:57.480 --> 00:12:00.060
That's the town where the 
Adventurers' Academy is, right?

00:12:00.060 --> 00:12:02.650
Yes. It's a mercantile town.

00:12:02.650 --> 00:12:05.440
There, even children can join merchant guilds,

00:12:05.440 --> 00:12:07.950
and sell what they gather.

00:12:08.330 --> 00:12:10.830
Then I can earn my tuition that way!

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:14.230
However, Breichburg is quite far away.

00:12:14.630 --> 00:12:17.240
You'll need to learn traveling magic, too.

00:12:17.240 --> 00:12:20.840
And by that, you mean teleporting and stuff?

00:12:21.190 --> 00:12:23.050
Maybe flying?

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:24.080
Flight magic, yes.

00:12:24.080 --> 00:12:28.060
Once you get used to it, 
you can travel at great speeds.

00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:29.010
Like so.

00:12:45.190 --> 00:12:48.440
Well, this is the wide world that awaits you!

00:13:34.690 --> 00:13:36.480
Your training ends tomorrow.

00:13:39.310 --> 00:13:40.920
Ow...

00:13:41.850 --> 00:13:43.880
Uh, why end so abruptly?

00:13:43.880 --> 00:13:45.180
It's not abrupt.

00:13:45.180 --> 00:13:46.840
You'll be fine.

00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:49.990
But I only just started practicing flight magic.

00:13:49.990 --> 00:13:51.850
You have the basics down.

00:13:51.850 --> 00:13:55.310
But... I can't control it very well yet.

00:13:55.310 --> 00:13:57.890
It'll grow stable if you practice every day.

00:13:57.890 --> 00:14:00.360
But it's only been two weeks since we started...

00:14:00.360 --> 00:14:01.150
Well...

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:19.540
I heard a Whispering Dead 
was spotted in the woods.

00:14:20.800 --> 00:14:23.250
Um, what's a Whispering Dead?

00:14:23.540 --> 00:14:25.740
An undead that has retained 
its cognitive powers.

00:14:25.740 --> 00:14:27.220
It can even hold conversations.

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:30.280
I've heard that they don't look 
very different from humans.

00:14:30.280 --> 00:14:32.340
But they're still corpses.

00:14:32.340 --> 00:14:36.690
Their bodies go cold, 
their senses stop functioning,

00:14:36.690 --> 00:14:38.940
and their skin grows terrifyingly pale.

00:14:51.570 --> 00:14:54.280
And in a few years, they lose their minds

00:14:54.280 --> 00:14:58.290
and become zombies that hunt 
people to sate their hunger.

00:15:11.450 --> 00:15:13.150
Master...

00:15:15.810 --> 00:15:17.470
What brings you here at this hour?

00:15:20.040 --> 00:15:21.270
Master!

00:15:21.270 --> 00:15:25.540
It seems a monster called a Whispering 
Dead has showed up in the woods!

00:15:28.360 --> 00:15:31.490
It's dangerous here, so come 
to the mansion with me!

00:15:36.750 --> 00:15:37.580
Well...

00:15:38.290 --> 00:15:41.860
Please, master! It's dangerous here!

00:15:41.860 --> 00:15:44.900
It's all right. The danger 
you speak of doesn't exist.

00:15:44.900 --> 00:15:46.430
How do you know?

00:15:46.430 --> 00:15:49.130
There's a Whispering Dead here!

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:50.460
So you realized.

00:15:53.140 --> 00:15:55.390
Let's go. Hurry.

00:15:56.720 --> 00:15:59.640
Well, I am the Whispering Dead.

00:16:00.760 --> 00:16:04.010
No! You aren't dead!

00:16:04.010 --> 00:16:05.150
You're not...

00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:10.340
It happened five years ago.

00:16:10.780 --> 00:16:15.160
The previous duke's eldest son 
contracted a deadly illness.

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:18.200
Looking for a panacea that could cure him,

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:22.460
the duke headed to an Enchanted 
Forest to clear it of monsters,

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:25.320
with his court magician, me, in tow.

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:31.560
We had an army of two thousand, 
but the monsters outnumbered us.

00:16:32.110 --> 00:16:34.980
No matter how many we killed, they kept coming.

00:16:36.240 --> 00:16:41.890
I was forced to fight while 
protecting the duke and the troops.

00:16:42.320 --> 00:16:46.400
Soon, my mana ran out, and I was overwhelmed.

00:16:51.320 --> 00:16:56.410
But I held a deep regret that 
turned me into a Whispering Dead.

00:16:56.950 --> 00:16:58.880
Well, did you know?

00:16:59.510 --> 00:17:02.740
When a Whispering Dead's wish 
is fulfilled, they pass on.

00:17:04.350 --> 00:17:06.130
And my wish was...

00:17:06.130 --> 00:17:11.880
to meet someone I could pass the magic 
I'd learned in my thirty years to.

00:17:13.590 --> 00:17:16.380
So when I sensed your presence,

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:20.260
I was overjoyed.

00:17:28.520 --> 00:17:31.480
But you were just a five-year-old child.

00:17:32.910 --> 00:17:36.700
I thought you might run away if 
I told you I was a Whispering Dead,

00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:38.460
so I lied on the spot.

00:17:38.460 --> 00:17:39.360
Forgive me.

00:17:42.180 --> 00:17:43.220
Say, Well...

00:17:43.800 --> 00:17:47.660
I want to confirm that you were 
the person I was seeking.

00:17:48.300 --> 00:17:50.370
Could you take my final trial?

00:17:52.350 --> 00:17:54.340
Purge me.

00:17:56.140 --> 00:17:58.740
I shall now teach you holy magic.

00:17:59.080 --> 00:18:02.970
It's used to purge undead like me.

00:18:02.970 --> 00:18:05.120
I can't use it anymore,

00:18:05.120 --> 00:18:07.400
but I'm sure you'll be able to destroy me.

00:18:07.400 --> 00:18:08.850
Wait a second!

00:18:08.850 --> 00:18:11.440
Are you asking me to destroy you?

00:18:11.440 --> 00:18:15.400
Well, it's been five years since 
I became a Whispering Dead.

00:18:17.550 --> 00:18:21.590
I won't be able to preserve myself 
in this state using mana much longer.

00:18:23.290 --> 00:18:27.790
I don't want to lose my sanity and 
become a zombie that attacks people.

00:18:28.730 --> 00:18:29.750
But...

00:18:30.610 --> 00:18:31.460
Listen.

00:18:31.930 --> 00:18:34.930
Holy magic is the same as 
the life force of creatures.

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:39.180
Picture duplicating the life 
force within you using mana.

00:18:40.120 --> 00:18:41.560
Start, Well.

00:18:50.210 --> 00:18:50.950
Master!

00:18:52.540 --> 00:18:56.140
This isn't enough, Well. Focus.

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:06.640
More, Well! Stronger!

00:19:07.560 --> 00:19:11.330
I can't! I can't erase you, Master!

00:19:11.700 --> 00:19:12.790
Well!

00:19:13.930 --> 00:19:15.250
Remember...

00:19:16.540 --> 00:19:20.370
Remember what you've learned 
in these two weeks.

00:19:34.790 --> 00:19:36.060
Rest assured...

00:19:36.490 --> 00:19:39.460
You will become a magician 
far greater than I.

00:19:40.290 --> 00:19:41.410
Rest assured...

00:19:43.990 --> 00:19:47.990
Wendelin von Benno Baumeister, 
my dear disciple,

00:19:50.310 --> 00:19:53.520
could you please put me at ease?

00:20:03.300 --> 00:20:06.760
Thank you for everything, Master.

00:20:10.450 --> 00:20:13.480
It's my turn to erase your fears!

00:20:17.190 --> 00:20:19.140
Thank you, Well.

00:20:33.600 --> 00:20:35.240
This is a wonderful magic spell.

00:20:35.240 --> 00:20:38.150
I'm being enveloped in a pleasant warmth.

00:20:44.280 --> 00:20:47.960
You truly were the magician 
I was looking for.

00:20:48.440 --> 00:20:49.660
Master...

00:20:56.320 --> 00:20:59.170
Well, your life is only beginning.

00:20:59.170 --> 00:21:01.010
Do your best, and do it smartly.

00:21:14.250 --> 00:21:16.010
Let us meet in the afterlife,

00:21:16.650 --> 00:21:18.110
maybe a hundred years from now.

00:21:45.040 --> 00:21:48.950
Your last teaching was,
"Do your best, and do it smartly"?

00:21:56.180 --> 00:21:57.320
I understand, master.

00:21:57.860 --> 00:21:59.530
I'll give it a shot.

00:22:16.190 --> 00:22:17.760
Take care!
